Open Steam's downloads, where the game's update is started

Usage: easyplay steam update [OPTIONS] <GAME>

Arguments:
  <GAME>  The game

Options:
  -v, --verbose...  Increase log verbosity (-v debug, -vv trace)
  -h, --help        Print help
